@startuml
title Video Suggestion System UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state UserRequestVideo
state IdentifyUser
state GatherVideos
state AddDetails
state SendSuggestions
state TrendingVideos
state SimilarTagVideos
state SimilarGenreVideos
state PromotedVideos

[*] --> StartChoice

StartChoice --> UserRequestVideo : User requests video [User requests video event]
UserRequestVideo --> IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser --> UserIdentified

state UserIdentified
UserIdentified --> GatherVideos
GatherVideos --> TrendingVideos : Get trending videos from user’s area [Trending guard]
GatherVideos --> SimilarTagVideos : Gather videos with similar tags [Similar tag guard]
GatherVideos --> SimilarGenreVideos : Gather videos from similar genres [Similar genre guard]
GatherVideos --> PromotedVideos : Get promoted videos [Promoted guard]
TrendingVideos --> AddDetails
SimilarTagVideos --> AddDetails
SimilarGenreVideos --> AddDetails
PromotedVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions --> [*]
@enduml
